SDV simple:

VSS :
    Sensor Signal VehicleSpeedSensor :
            trigger period 100ms+/-0ms offset varying
            latency 4.87ms+/-0.5493ms
    Actuator Signal FrontBrakeActuator :
            trigger on event self
            latency 5ms+/-0.006ms
App :
    Component C :
        Signal LocalSpeed
        Signal LocalBrake
        Service VehicleSpeedReader :
            subscribe to 
                - queue VSS.VehicleSpeedSensor
            publish to
                - App.LocalSpeed
            trigger on VehicleSpeedSensor
            execution 7ms+/-0.004ms
        
        Service BrakeController :
            subscribe to
                - var App.LocalSpeed
            publish to
                - App.LocalBrake
            trigger period 250ms+/-0ms offset varying
            execution 4.05ms+/-0.2244ms

        Service FrontBrakeWriter:
            subscribe to
                - queue App.LocalBrake
            publish to 
                - VSS.FrontBrakeActuator
            trigger on LocalBrake
            execution 7.87ms+/-0.4822ms

Functional Chains:
    chain : VehicleSpeedSensor -> VehicleSpeedReader -> BrakeController -> FrontBrakeWriter -> FrontBrakeActuator
